Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:12.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你翻垃圾桶了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You picked through the garbage?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.65,0:04:14.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，很不体面，但我得有套方法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, it's very classy, but I had to have a system
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:17.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才能记住谁是谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I can remember who everybody is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:20.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还在每个人下面标了姓和职业。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you have, uh, last names and professions on everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真厉害。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:25.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我问了很多问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, well, I ask a lot of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:26.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你从哪儿弄到那些便利贴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you get those Post
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.57,0:04:27.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}控制室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？不行，不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:32.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，塞雷娜，控制室是禁飞区。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Serena, the control room is a no-fly zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:34.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多萝西在这儿可没资格偷看幕后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dorothy doesn't get to peek behind the curtain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.61,0:04:36.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我已经看了。买把锁吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I did. So buy a lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:39.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者开除该看守的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or fire whoever was supposed to be guarding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.55,0:04:41.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我四点起来，里面根本没人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was up at 4:00, there was no one in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.45,0:04:43.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，顺便说一句，我看了你们拍男嘉宾的监控。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I saw your security cameras on the guys, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:45.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是看了监控，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Saw the security cameras, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.89,0:04:48.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！那个牛仔打呼噜超响。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Cowboy snores big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.82,0:04:51.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，塞雷娜，我们真的希望你放松投入\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so, Serena, we really just want you to relax into this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:53.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让一切自然发生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and let things happen naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:54.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那变数也太大了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That leaves way too much up to chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:56.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想淘汰错人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to cut the wrong guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:58.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我得把每个候选人区分清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I need to individuate the contenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:04:59.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，你可不想让错的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, you wouldn't want to have the wrong guy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.60,0:05:01.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从你的缝里溜过去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}slip through your crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:03.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我收购公司就是这么做的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's how I buy companies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.07,0:05:04.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以用别的方式\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so doing this any other way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:06.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是不负责任。我懂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}would be irresponsible. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是——贾斯珀，贾斯珀，贾斯珀，贾斯珀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just -- Jasper, Jasper, Jasper, Jasper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:10.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，贾斯珀是我的菜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. Jasper is my guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.44,0:05:12.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈佛商学院——好吧，听着，塞雷娜，我知道昨晚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}HBS -- All right, listen, Serena, I know that things got,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:14.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，昨晚有点失控。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, things got a little wild last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只是想把一切控制住——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're just trying to get everything under control --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:19.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这跟控制或者昨晚毫无关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This has nothing to do with control or last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.45,0:05:21.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，以后别再跟我提那事儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And how about you never talk to me about that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:26.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们能给我点空间准备一下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I get some space, you guys, to prepare, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:28.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:30.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行，当然。呃，嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, sure. Uh, um.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:32.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个，我们今晚其实给你安排了扑克局。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, we actually set up a poker game for you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就，你知道，出去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just, you know, go out there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:35.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让男嘉宾们看看你多厉害。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and just show the guys how impressive you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:37.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我肯定会碾压全场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I am gonna kill this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:44.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扑克局？哦，那会很性感。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Poker game? Oh, that will be sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:45.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是不是嗑药了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, she's on something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:46.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，她只是紧张，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, she's just nervous, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:48.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她真的非常非常紧张。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's really, really nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你就得给她接上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, then you need to get her hooked up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:51.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}龙舌兰点滴，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to a tequila I.V., all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:53.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要她喝得滑溜溜、好上手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need her lubed up and user friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:55.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望今天至少要有十次\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to be worried about a gang-bang
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}担心会出群交这种事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at least 10 times today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:58.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十次，真的吗？奎恩，这也太多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}10 times, really? Quinn, that feels like a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.53,0:06:00.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，奎恩，呃，我在想能不能——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Quinn, uh, I was wondering if --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:02.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一点都不多，相信我。我在说话呢！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is not a lot, trust me. I am having a conversation!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:04.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，见到你我也很高兴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, it's great to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.70,0:06:06.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一位惊艳的女主角。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One stunning Suitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:08.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}13位出色的男士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}13 amazing guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.94,0:06:11.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全都比以往更努力地想赢得芳心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All working harder than ever to try to get lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:13.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为今天，我们要去拉斯维加斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because today, we're going Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:16.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有一位特别的神秘嘉宾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Featuring a very special mystery guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！天哪，我希望是科波菲尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh! Gosh, I hope it's Copperfield
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:21.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后把你变没，格雷厄姆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and they make you disappear, Graham.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:23.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，卡！我需要重来，给我发牌，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, cut! I need a reset and deal me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:25.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位，动起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}people, let's go.
