Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.62,0:06:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，你们这些罪人。欢迎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, you sinners. Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.59,0:06:32.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们面前是价值五百美元的筹码。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In front of you is $500 worth of chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:33.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你们好运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:35.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他们会需要的。  -谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-They are gonna need it.   -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始了，小伙子们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:39.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我提醒你们，我扑克打得很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will warn you, I am very good at poker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:42.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗯。  -我有点害怕，大概吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mm-hmm.   -I'm scared, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.07,0:06:43.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们押200。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll do 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:45.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦呵呵，大手笔啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh-ho-ho, big spender?
