Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:54.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}32？太惨了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}32? That's depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:56.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能不能说她29？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't we say she's like 29?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:58.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，不能那么说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, we can't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:06:59.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是——因为那不是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well -- Because it's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.85,0:07:01.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那说她是离异的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, say she's divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:03.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少曾经有人想要她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least at some point somebody wanted her.
