Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:17.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得他真的是，呃——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think he really is the, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:19.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家说的那个天才吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the genius that they say he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:22.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。我得说他绝对是，呃，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. I'd say he was definitely the, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.18,0:07:24.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个房间里第二聪明的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the second smartest person in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.81,0:07:26.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。这下她就是在吹嘘了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hm. Well, now she's just bragging.
