Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.09,0:07:41.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你把全部人生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If all you do is put all of your life
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:43.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和精力都投入工作和事业\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and energy into your job and your career
