Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:54.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。Maddy。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here. Maddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.45,0:11:58.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.08,0:11:59.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚把我们的人弄丢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just lost us our girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.85,0:12:02.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}输给了切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.46,0:12:04.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都回里面去，伙计们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back inside, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:11.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:17.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而塞蕾娜这次可真是火力全开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O0 C1 Iand Serena is certainlyt burning it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:18.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，她在扑克桌上把我们的男嘉宾都赢惨了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see, she slayed our guys at poker,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.91,0:12:21.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她的运气能在掷骰子桌上撑住吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but will her luck hold at the craps table?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:24.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们就看看骰子怎么落地吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's see how the dice fall, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.54,0:12:26.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要加上，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am gonna add, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，呃，是——是Guy和Preston，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, um, it's -- it's Guy and Preston, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.45,0:12:33.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。你能帮我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:35.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能，当然能。对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I sure can. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:38.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是想要烤甜菜鹰嘴豆泥的食谱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want a recipe for roasted beet hummus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:39.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，真有意思，因为我就是个厨师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's really funny, 'cause I'm a chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:42.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可这位Preston不过是又一个来自佛罗里达的老白男\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Preston here is just another old white dude from Florida
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想在自己话说完前别漏尿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}trying to finish his sentence without leaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.03,0:12:45.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么跟你说的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What'd I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:47.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们在为她争风吃醋。嘿，我来维加斯的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're fighting over her. Hey, I've been coming to Vegas
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:48.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还在穿尿布呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}since before you were in diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.60,0:12:49.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要是你，就会加点赔率。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I were you, I'd add odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.90,0:12:52.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，哇。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, wow. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.30,0:12:54.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是个好主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:56.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:57.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:13:00.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—嘿！  -—哦！哦，哇！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey!   -Oh! Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:02.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你正走运呢，塞蕾娜。广撒网吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're on a streak, Serena. Play the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:04.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我支持你，宝贝。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna back you, baby. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:06.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我押100在“大八”上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me get 100 on Big Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，押“大八”。你知道吗，我也算一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, on Big Eight. You know what, count me in, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.96,0:13:10.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下，大块头。哦，我的天，太棒了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, big guy. Oh, my goodness, that is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:12.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从吧台顺了一瓶香槟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I swiped a bottle of champagne from the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.89,0:13:14.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。你越早把所有筹码押出去，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. The sooner you bet all your chips,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:15.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就能越早离开这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the sooner we can get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你真坏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you are so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.06,0:13:19.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，他确实坏。香槟大盗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, he is. Champagne bandit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:22.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—嘿！  -—啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey!   -Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:27.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们全是我的幸运符！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're all a bunch of good luck charms!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:29.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么跟你说的？所以才需要我在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did I tell you? That's why you need me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.94,0:13:31.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是个“男人类学家”！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am a man-thropologist!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.98,0:13:34.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，宝贝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:35.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！嗨！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:37.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:40.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，你回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:41.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚不是要上学吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't it a school night?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:46.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上回来，好吗？好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be right back, okay? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.03,0:13:48.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们可不是什么善茬。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're no funny guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:54.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我是来找你谈的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I actually came to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.47,0:13:58.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我迫不及待了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:00.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有——有点私密。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-It's kind of private.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:03.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且只有你能帮我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're the only one who can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，切特要捐一栋楼给Calgrove——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Chet is giving a building to Calgrove --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是“切特 Wilton真人秀电视研究中心”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it is the Chet Wilton Center for Reality Television Studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。这才叫高等教育。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Talk about higher learning. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:15.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他让我负责这场筹款晚宴，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's put me in charge of this fundraising dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.29,0:14:18.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以前从没做过这种事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I have never done anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:21.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特跟我说你以前帮他打理事务特别厉害\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet told me you were amazing at handling his business
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.29,0:14:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们在一起的时候，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when you guys were together,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.40,0:14:26.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我想也许你能把这个，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I thought maybe you could make this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.20,0:14:27.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也办得特别棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like, really amazing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:30.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这要求可不小，Crystal。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a pretty big ask, Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:32.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我跳不了那么高。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think I can jump that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.17,0:14:33.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就——就是切特终于\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-It's just so important that Chet finally
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.71,0:14:36.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得到他应得的认可，这太重要了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}gets the recognition he deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:39.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毕竟，他可是那个改变了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, after all, he is the visionary that changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:41.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}改变了，呃，无线电视“语法”的远见者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like, the "grammar" of network television.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让角色\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, it was his idea for characters
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直接对着镜头说话，是他的主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to talk directly to camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:46.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。那——那是他教你的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm. Is that -- Is that what he's teaching you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:48.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这不只是关于他的事业，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it's not just about his career,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.69,0:14:51.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还关于他和他父亲之间的整个人生故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's about his whole personal story with his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:54.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他能取得这么大的成功真是不可思议\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, it's incredible that he's had so much success
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:56.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毕竟他小时候起步那么艰难。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when he had such a tough start as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.63,0:14:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特的父亲在他6岁时就走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet's father left when he was 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:00.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那又怎样？有很多孩子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So what? There's a lot of kids
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都是单亲养大的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that have been raised by one parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.47,0:15:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但切特的父亲不只是离开了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Chet's father didn't just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:08.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，他自杀了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, he took his own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:11.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，切特发现他的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, the way that Chet found him
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:13.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在车库里，车还发动着……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the garage with the car still running...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大多数人经历这种事都走不出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Most people don't get past something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.65,0:15:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但切特不是大多数人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Chet isn't most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:23.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。你知道，我——我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. You know, I -- I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:25.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得回去工作了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:29.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？好。呃，那你愿意帮忙吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? Okay. Uh, so will you help?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.23,0:15:31.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，当然。别担心，克丽丝特尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, yeah. Don't you worry, Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:33.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会，呃——我会给你所有需要的帮助。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will, uh -- I will give you all the help you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:35.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他满嘴胡扯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's so full of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.67,0:15:40.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.51,0:15:42.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可整个节目本该按我的意愿来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But this whole show is supposed to be about what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.01,0:15:44.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，到底怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, what the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.58,0:15:47.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要和比利单独约会。他真的迷上我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want a one-on-one with Billy. He's really into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:49.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，因为你表现得像个无脑花瓶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, because you are acting like a bimbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢了，但我已经有个怨气冲天的闺蜜了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks, but I already have a bitter best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.15,0:15:53.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我缺的是个丈夫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What I don't have is a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:55.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，我要和比利单独约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hence, a one-on-one with Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就现在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:15:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我赞成给她这个机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I say we give it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.79,0:16:01.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她——你知道，她只是刚找到状态，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She -- You know, she's just getting her groove on,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，进入状态了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, getting in the zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:05.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就顺着她吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's just roll with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.03,0:16:07.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行。让她跟赛车小子跑一圈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. Let her do a lap with Speed Racer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:08.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开什么玩笑？嘿，宝贝。你好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you kidding me? Hey, baby. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:10.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Billy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.14,0:16:11.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们选他上节目只是因为他一点就着——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We only picked him for the show because he has a short fuse --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:14.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，他是职业赛车手，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, he is a professional race car driver, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:16.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在中部州他就是王室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is flyover state royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:18.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要中部州的收视率。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need flyover state ratings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:20.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚本来应该是集体约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tonight is supposed to be a group date.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.51,0:16:23.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一季现在安排单独约会还太早了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is way too early in the season for a one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:24.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，恕我直言，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, with all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:27.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加里拿刀架在我脖子上，不是你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gary has a knife at my throat, not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.09,0:16:29.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以今晚——至少今晚——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, for tonight -- at least --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:31.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能不能闭上嘴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you could just keep your mouth shut
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:33.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干好你该死的活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and do your damn job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:35.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也“爱你哟”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I "wuv" "woo" too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.43,0:16:37.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我错过什么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What'd I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别再派你的小新娘来替你干脏活了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't ever send your child bride to do your dirty work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，克丽丝特尔六月就满24了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Crystal's gonna turn 24 in June.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:45.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她请我帮忙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She asked me to help with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:49.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}办你那个篡改历史、给你自己贴金的筹款活动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}your revisionist-history ego-boosting fundraiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:52.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她去找你了？天，那可真需要勇气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She went to you? God, that takes guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.28,0:16:54.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想让尊重你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if you want her to respect you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:56.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许你该别再对她撒谎了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}maybe you should stop telling her lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:59.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和克丽丝特尔的关系无比坦诚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crystal and I have an incredibly honest relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.49,0:17:01.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧！是啊，是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, please! Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:03.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟她讲了那整套苦情故事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You told her that whole sob-story
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:05.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说你父亲自杀的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about your father killing himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:07.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.49,0:17:09.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不该撒谎，对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I shouldn't have lied, and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.76,0:17:12.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别跟我说，跟她说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, don't tell me, tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:15.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸爸确实自杀了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My dad did kill himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.87,0:17:18.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你讲的家里其他事都是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything else I told you about my family was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.27,0:17:20.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是另外那一部分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just that one other part.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说这件事让我觉得丢脸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It felt shameful to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:25.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.68,0:17:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克丽丝特尔让我有足够的安全感\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crystal makes me feel safe enough
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.35,0:17:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去接纳自己不同的部分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to accept the different parts of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:33.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.26,0:17:40.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我——你——你——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I -- You -- You --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:43.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你——你认识她才多久，三个月？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You -- y-you've known her, what, like three months?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:44.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是真的，奎妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's real, Quinnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.66,0:17:47.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:50.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也希望你拥有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:53.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会改变人生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's life-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.71,0:17:56.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.74,0:17:58.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我信——是什么——是什么来着，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure what -- what is it, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:02.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每月两万美元零花钱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}$20,000 a month allowance?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我信那确实很能改变人生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure that's real life-changing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.15,0:18:05.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对克丽丝特尔来说也一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for Crystal, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:07.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.49,0:18:10.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:14.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.40,0:18:27.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全国少年组冠军，我15岁那年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O0 C1 The National Pee-Wee Crown ewhen I was 15.s 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.37,0:18:29.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，太厉害了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特朗普票仓会爱死这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trump country's gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:33.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}17岁时拿了银冠。哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Silver Crown when I was 17. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:34.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我讨厌这个节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hate this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:36.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我去了麻省理工，又成了赛车手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then I went to MIT and became a stock car driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:38.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你上过麻省理工？不会吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You went to MIT? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，我只是想看看你有没有在听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I wanted to see if you were paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太逗了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are so funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:46.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丹，马上把他嘴里的口香糖拿出来！你真逗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dan, get that gum out of his mouth right now! You're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.26,0:18:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你的口香糖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need your gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.43,0:18:50.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.23,0:18:51.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了。不好意思啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Awesome. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:18:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:19:01.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，那跟我说说开车的事吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, so, tell me about driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.51,0:19:04.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:06.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:10.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么，只是，呃，你知道，你看起来有点……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing, just, uh, you know, seem a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:13.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.95,0:19:17.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是想聊聊，我就在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you need to talk, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.29,0:19:18.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把话说清楚，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's get one thing straight,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:23.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我永远不需要谈心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will never need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.46,0:19:27.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你要是还想拿那点辛苦钱，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So if you enjoy getting your barely-earned paychecks,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.27,0:19:29.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就永远别再问我那种话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you won't ever ask me that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:35.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.31,0:19:39.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又快又危险，太酷了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fast and dangerous, that's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.68,0:19:41.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听起来像我的梦中情人。给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sounds like my dream man. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:43.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:46.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着你的女权主义者变成这样，感觉如何？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you like watching your feminist turn into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.55,0:19:49.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不，我的生活对观众来说太无聊了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, my life is boring to our viewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不确定。你看起来像……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know about that. You seem like...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:53.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.49,0:19:56.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欧文，呃，嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Owen, uh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.93,0:19:58.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，过来。我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, come here. I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.43,0:20:02.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，没事吧？我不知道，我只是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, everything okay? I don't know, I'm just --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.50,0:20:04.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有点担心塞蕾娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm feeling a little bit worried about Serena.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:05.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她跟那个比利在里面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's in there with that guy Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:07.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那家伙真是个混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the guy is, like, such a douche.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.61,0:20:09.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，不过塞蕾娜很聪明。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, Serena's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:10.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她自己会看出来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She'll figure that out on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.01,0:20:12.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道，我觉得你得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, I kind of feel like you need
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:14.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进去救她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to go in there and save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不是我的风格。你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not really my thing. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:18.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟她有过那么棒的第一吻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You had that great first kiss with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.82,0:20:21.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的觉得你应该进去捍卫它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really think you should just go in there and defend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.45,0:20:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那只会让她不自在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's just gonna make her feel uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.86,0:20:24.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会让她不自在的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not gonna make her feel uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那会很尴尬。她正在约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That seems awkward. I mean, she's on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:26.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说了他不想去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said he doesn't want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让我做节目制作吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you let me produce the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:30.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……哦，你是说操纵别人去做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... Oh, you mean manipulate someone into doing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们不想做的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}something that they don't want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.06,0:20:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.03,0:20:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，瑞秋。呃，我不想惹麻烦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, Rachel. Uh, I don't want to cause any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.44,0:20:38.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，能跟你快说两句吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, can I talk to you really quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:39.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还记得那条裙子吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you remember that dress
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.01,0:20:41.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们想让我在开幕式穿的那条？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you guys wanted me to wear at the opening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:42.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能帮我拿来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think you could get it for me?
