Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.20,0:30:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去叫保安，不然我就报警。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You get security or I am calling the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.23,0:30:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，过来，过来。等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, come here, come here. Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.20,0:30:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上要出现一个无价的瞬间了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is a priceless moment that is just about to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.47,0:30:08.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在要一台摄像机对准贾斯珀。还有欧文。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need a camera right now on Jasper. And Owen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.17,0:30:10.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你没事吧？哦，看，看，看！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you okay? Oh, look, look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.04,0:30:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁会先冲到塞雷娜那儿？这要出事的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's gonna get to Serena first? This is a liability!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.91,0:30:13.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，等一下！等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, hold on a minute! Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.35,0:30:17.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等着看吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.28,0:30:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 从前那样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* The way it was
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.16,0:30:25.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 哦，我们再也回不到从前的样子了 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, and we're never gonna go back to the way we was *
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.66,0:30:27.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这个！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.26,0:30:30.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种剧情根本写不出来！看看！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You cannot write that stuff! Look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.13,0:30:33.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 告诉我你想不想和我们一起混 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Tell me if you wanna roll with the rest of us *
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.60,0:30:36.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是我要的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.60,0:30:38.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是我一直在等的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what I was waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.50,0:30:40.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.44,0:30:42.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会出现在每一支预告片里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is gonna be in every promo
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.21,0:30:44.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一季剩下的每一支。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for the rest of the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.31,0:30:46.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戈德堡，来我办公室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goldberg, to my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.21,0:30:48.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 从前那样 砰！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* The way it was Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.32,0:30:55.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}O0 C1\N{\rEN\blur0.8}O0 C1
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.05,0:30:58.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜你发了场小脾气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Congratulations on your little temper tantrum
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.06,0:31:00.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟街头斗士巴雷什尼科夫一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with street fighter Baryshnikov.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.63,0:31:02.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，你想怎么捧我都行，奎恩，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, you can flatter me all you want, Quinn,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.23,0:31:04.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我绝对没重新上这条船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I'm so not back on this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.13,0:31:07.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚派阿列克谢进去，阻止这场核泄漏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just sent Alexi in to stop the nuclear leak
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.23,0:31:09.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这节目已经成核泄漏了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that this show has become.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.17,0:31:12.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！我明白了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.14,0:31:15.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这根本是你在气头上对我竖中指。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This was a big F-U to me because you're pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.54,0:31:17.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但说真的，面对现实吧，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, I mean, come on, face it,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.68,0:31:19.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好的作品都是这时候做出来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that's when you do your best work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.64,0:31:22.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你的缪斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am your muse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.38,0:31:25.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，这一点都不好笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, this is not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.35,0:31:27.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，不管你喜不喜欢，真人秀塑造了我们的世界。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, like it or not, reality TV shapes our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.65,0:31:29.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.49,0:31:32.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在往年轻女性的脑子里灌毒泥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're pumping toxic sludge into the minds of young women.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.19,0:31:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在告诉她们，她们必须\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're telling them that they have to
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.46,0:31:36.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}装傻才能钓到男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}dummy themselves down to land some dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.20,0:31:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许这就是事实。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, maybe it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.50,0:31:41.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，看看我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.57,0:31:43.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.74,0:31:47.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以呢？你就这么放弃了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what? You're just giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.27,0:31:49.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.34,0:31:51.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想要她想要的东西，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want what she wants, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.98,0:31:53.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胡说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.38,0:31:55.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要的就是她想要的那些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want exactly what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.15,0:31:57.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只是不敢承认罢了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're just too scared to admit it
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.05,0:32:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你怕自己永远得不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because you're afraid you're never gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.55,0:32:02.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当时眼睛都亮了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you went all googly-eyed
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.09,0:32:03.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}约翰·布斯说想跟你生孩子的时候，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when John Booth said he wanted to have your baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.76,0:32:05.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你彻底慌了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you completely freaked out
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.32,0:32:07.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就因为切特给你的那颗钻戒——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}over that diamond ring that Chet gave you --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.59,0:32:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行了，够了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, enough, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.23,0:32:13.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说的是实话。滚出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm telling the truth. Just get the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.00,0:32:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩——出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn -- Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.23,0:32:17.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，奎恩，那个赛车手比利\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Quinn, um, Race Car Billy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.14,0:32:18.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弄到手机打给了他律师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}got his hands on a phone and called his lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.40,0:32:19.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说是阿列克谢挑衅他，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's saying that Alexi provoked him
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.64,0:32:22.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一切都是个圈套。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and it's all a big set-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.74,0:32:24.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得漂亮啊，天才。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great work, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.58,0:32:27.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.65,0:32:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.15,0:32:34.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚真够疯狂的，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crazy night, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.39,0:32:36.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.26,0:32:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.59,0:32:40.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}裙子是毁了，不过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The dress is trashed, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.09,0:32:44.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，我更喜欢你上一条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eh. To be honest, I liked the last one better.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.46,0:32:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.43,0:32:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得那条更像你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seemed more you, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.37,0:32:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.64,0:32:52.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.60,0:32:54.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.37,0:32:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.71,0:32:57.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}之前在掷骰子那儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, earlier at the craps table
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.38,0:32:59.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有后来跟比利那会儿，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then with Billy,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.61,0:33:01.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你显得有点不一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you seemed kind of different.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.68,0:33:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就好像你在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like maybe you were
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.55,0:33:07.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}故意装傻似的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}dumbing yourself down or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.09,0:33:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欧文，你昨天才认识我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, Owen, you met me yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.36,0:33:12.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你根本不了解我是什么人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so you don't really know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.72,0:33:16.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想说的是，你在我面前不用那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What I mean to say is that you don't have to do that with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.06,0:33:18.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在你面前也什么都不用做啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I don't really have to do anything with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.33,0:33:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.43,0:33:22.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞——塞蕾娜……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}W-- Serena...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.50,0:33:28.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.41,0:33:33.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.48,0:33:35.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总算结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure glad that's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.18,0:33:37.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.22,0:33:39.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你碰巧有没有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, uh, did you happen to...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.78,0:33:42.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打听到刚果的消息？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}get any news on the Congo at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.32,0:33:44.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。太抱歉了，我——没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't. I am so sorry, it just c-- It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.52,0:33:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我完全忘了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it completely slipped my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.66,0:33:47.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我——没事，没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm -- That's fine. It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.79,0:33:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事，没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's fine. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.63,0:33:53.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚这个活动——我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This thing tonight -- I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.43,0:33:55.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿西装我觉得很可笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel ridiculous in a suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.57,0:34:01.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会，你帅极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. You look amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.61,0:34:03.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.71,0:34:06.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不对……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.21,0:34:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Except for, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.12,0:34:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.72,0:34:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.46,0:34:19.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我现在在工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, I'm working right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.63,0:34:23.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.50,0:34:26.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.84,0:34:33.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘿，比利要告我们吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey, so, is Billy gonna sue us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.20,0:34:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加里一直逼我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gary's all over my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.67,0:34:36.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把加里打发回家了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I sent Gary home, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.88,0:34:38.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟比利谈好了交换条件，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got a quid pro quo from Billy,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.88,0:34:42.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但前提是塞蕾娜不淘汰他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but that's only if Serena doesn't cut him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.15,0:34:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will she?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.72,0:34:45.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她气坏了。气我们所有人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's pretty pissed. At all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.52,0:34:47.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，补妆。行了，这样够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, makeup. Ah, that's good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.35,0:34:48.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些淤青是遮不掉的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not gonna get all those bruises out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.62,0:34:49.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，准备好了吗？——好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-All right. Ready?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.62,0:34:50.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开机，格雷厄姆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And action, Graham.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.62,0:34:52.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.76,0:34:55.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，显然这是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, obviously it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.36,0:34:56.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是个充满惊喜的夜晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's been a night of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.66,0:34:58.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们还没结束。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we're still not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.16,0:35:00.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们中有11位将继续\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see, 11 of you will be continuing
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.27,0:35:02.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和塞蕾娜一起的旅程。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on your journey with Serena.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.53,0:35:04.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但不幸的是，有两位\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But unfortunately for two of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.54,0:35:06.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉斯维加斯就是你们的终点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vegas is your last stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.44,0:35:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过不管你们今晚走哪条路，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But no matter which road you're on tonight, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.37,0:35:11.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们每个人都会得到一份特别的、\N{\rEN\blur0.8}each one of you will receive a very special,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.34,0:35:14.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纪念版《永恒》胎压计\N{\rEN\blur0.8}commemorative "Everlasting" tire gauge
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.95,0:35:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}由我们的比利·伯德和伯德赛车配件公司赞助。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}courtesy of our own Billy Byrd and Byrd Racing Accessories.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.22,0:35:20.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在拨打，并提到《永恒》\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So call now and mention "Everlasting"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.42,0:35:23.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有赛车用品一律九折。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and get 10% off on all of your race car needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.52,0:35:26.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这都成比利的电视购物了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, it's just a Billy infomercial now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.26,0:35:29.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总比吃官司强。今天真是疯狂的一天，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Beats a lawsuit.   -It has been such a crazy day,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.53,0:35:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我还是很高兴能在这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I am still very excited to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.23,0:35:35.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很欣赏你们所有人的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I admire all of your...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.27,0:35:36.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}热情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.90,0:35:38.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望能看到更多\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I hope to see more of that
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.64,0:35:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我们接下来的旅程里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as we continue on this journey together.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.27,0:35:44.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沃伦，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Warren,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.34,0:35:45.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}普雷斯顿，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Preston,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.54,0:35:46.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贾斯珀，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jasper,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.78,0:35:50.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来拿你们的胎压计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}come and get your tire gauges.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.22,0:35:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—阿列克谢……  -—哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Alexi...   -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.92,0:35:54.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好的。  -……扎克，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes.   -...Zach,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.49,0:35:56.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}盖伊，我不能纵容暴力，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guy, I can't condone violence,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.69,0:35:58.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但确实挺刺激的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but there is something exciting
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.72,0:36:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成为那种关注的焦点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about being the center of that kind of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.86,0:36:02.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.79,0:36:05.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奥古斯特、巴里、杰米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}August, Barry, Jamie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.73,0:36:07.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一直试图置身事外，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You tried to stay above the fray,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.67,0:36:11.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很欣赏这一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I really appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.67,0:36:14.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欧文，我觉得我们快要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Owen, I feel like we're in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.51,0:36:16.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失去曾经拥有的东西了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of losing what we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.24,0:36:18.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你愿意，我想再试一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm willing to give it another shot if you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.71,0:36:21.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你愿意收下这个胎压计吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you accept this tire gauge?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.25,0:36:25.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。不，嘿，这是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. No, hey, it's --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.75,0:36:27.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不不不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.02,0:36:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心。我还是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry. I'm still me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.32,0:36:35.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞雷娜，这是今晚最后一个胎压计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serena, this is the last tire gauge of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.83,0:36:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.50,0:36:40.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，选比利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, pick Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.90,0:36:42.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别坑我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not screw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.57,0:36:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们说好的，塞雷娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We had a deal, Serena.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.84,0:36:46.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.34,0:36:48.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把阿列克谢打晕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You cold-cocked Alexi.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.61,0:36:51.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且你那通发作太幼稚了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And your outburst was childish.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.51,0:36:53.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.38,0:36:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我喜欢有血性的男人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I like a man with fire in his belly,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.61,0:36:57.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以这个胎压计给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so this tire gauge is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.78,0:37:00.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.42,0:37:01.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩的交换条件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn pro quo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.72,0:37:03.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别抱太大希望。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't get your hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.76,0:37:05.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肯和亚伦，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ken and Aaron,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.36,0:37:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你们，今天很棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to thank you guys for a great day.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.76,0:37:08.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们的车在等着了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your cars are waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.59,0:37:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡。收工。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And cut. That's a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.71,0:37:22.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}O0 C1 -嗨，看，成功了。嗯哼。-嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-O0 C1 -Hi,See, it worked. Mm-hmm.   -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.44,0:37:23.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}裙子不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.54,0:37:24.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.54,0:37:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让这些家伙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got these guys
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.88,0:37:28.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对你服服帖帖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}eating out of the palm of your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.08,0:37:29.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺便谢谢你帮忙处理比利那件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you for your help with this Billy thing, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.95,0:37:31.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，那张捐款支票最好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, well, the donation check better be
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.82,0:37:34.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天下班前送到圣何塞青年收容所。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to the San Jose Youth Shelter by end of business tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.08,0:37:35.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包在我身上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Consider it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.06,0:37:39.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.82,0:37:41.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得太对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are so right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.59,0:37:43.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那真是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.56,0:37:44.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.76,0:37:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.40,0:37:51.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，男人真蠢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, men are stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.90,0:37:54.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.71,0:37:56.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.08,0:38:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.91,0:38:04.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么？欧文现在成你的小跟班了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what? Owen's like your little buddy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.85,0:38:06.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那又怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.39,0:38:08.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是你的计划？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.55,0:38:10.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你回来是为了保护那些“好人”？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you come back here to protect the "good guys"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.82,0:38:13.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就打算这样给自己赎罪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's how you're gonna redeem yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.76,0:38:15.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.46,0:38:16.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的计划是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.93,0:38:20.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.53,0:38:21.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要我拿着吗？好，我来拿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Want me to hold it? Okay, I can take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.73,0:38:23.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为你想让我拿着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thought you wanted me to hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.10,0:38:24.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我为什么要你拿着？我也不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why would I want you to hold it? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.47,0:38:26.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是小牛皮的还是鱼子酱的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that the calfskin or the caviar?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.50,0:38:29.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实是小羊皮的，但没有那个涂鸦图案。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's actually the lambskin, but without the graffiti thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.14,0:38:31.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你那条花朵肩带在哪买的？是别人送的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you get the flower strap? It was a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.14,0:38:32.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.44,0:38:33.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我的车来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my car's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.45,0:38:34.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜。哦，好。拜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye. Oh, okay. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.55,0:38:35.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.42,0:38:40.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.02,0:38:43.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.80,0:38:52.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.46,0:38:53.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.00,0:38:56.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.87,0:38:58.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想跟进一下刚果的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wanted to follow up about the Congo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.94,0:39:00.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，好，太好了。是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, okay, oh, great. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.77,0:39:03.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好像联合国要介入了……是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, it seems like the UN is gonna intervene... Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.78,0:39:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……叛军也签了停火协议。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and the rebels signed a cease-fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.41,0:39:08.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。谢谢你。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's awesome. Thank you. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.15,0:39:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.62,0:39:12.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挪过去点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}move over.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.05,0:39:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事，够两个人躺的。哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay, it's big enough for two. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.78,0:39:17.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我们小心点，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if we're careful,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.42,0:39:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它就会在我们周围展开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it will expand around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.16,0:39:21.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白我的意思吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.03,0:39:24.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.56,0:39:30.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}舒服吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Comfy?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.54,0:39:31.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你知道吗，在南半球\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, do you know in the southern hemisphere
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.00,0:39:34.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些星星……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we have some stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.57,0:39:36.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们永远看不到？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you never see?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.57,0:39:39.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我们共有的那些，看起来也完全不一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the ones that we do share, they look totally different.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.55,0:39:42.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。那……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.91,0:39:45.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们——你们有猎户座吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you guys -- You guys have Orion?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.82,0:39:49.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是猎户座。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's Orion.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.79,0:39:52.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。好吧。差不多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Okay. Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.19,0:39:55.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.07,0:40:05.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……哇，哇！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um... Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.24,0:40:07.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们明天要早起开工。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have an early call tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.67,0:40:09.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.21,0:40:11.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.94,0:40:12.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.63,0:40:35.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我不想再害怕了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I don't want to fear no more
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.10,0:40:38.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.64,0:40:42.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 你能让我变美吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Can you make me beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.57,0:40:46.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 哦，哦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.64,0:40:50.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 还有太多话要说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* There is so much more to say
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.18,0:40:53.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 但你一言不发\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* But you don't say a word
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.78,0:40:55.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我是太阳，我是雨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I'm the sun, I'm the rain
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.79,0:40:57.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 把我拉下去，再次沉沦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Pull me under, under again
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.89,0:41:01.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我想走，我想去风吹的地方 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I want to go, I want to go where the wind blows *
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.29,0:41:06.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 让我沉沦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Pull me under
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.26,0:41:10.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 够了，放我走吧，August。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* It's enough, just let me go August.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.60,0:41:12.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我闯祸了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Am I in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.30,0:41:14.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 让我沉沦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Pull me under
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.14,0:41:15.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.91,0:41:18.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}August？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}August?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.74,0:41:21.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 哦，哦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.21,0:41:23.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我是太阳，我是雨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I'm the sun, I'm the rain
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.75,0:41:28.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 哦，哦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.02,0:41:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 让我沉沦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Pull me under
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.96,0:41:36.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 放我走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.66,0:41:39.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.66,0:41:43.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.33,0:41:49.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 让我沉沦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Pull me under
